  "2026-08-14T07:55:39.330Z","harness:codex","Completion evidence: exported ASSURANCE_MEASUREMENT_SOURCE_KINDS is the single 9-kind vocabulary, registry writes validate before persistence, command-scoped contracts expose the full vocabulary without default-budget truncation, and packed CLI invalid-source mutation returned typed exit 2. Linked 59-test assurance/contracts run and final exact 7,288-test coverage passed."
  "2026-08-14T09:03:15.217Z","harness:codex","Review-closeout evidence: CodeRabbit's exact-message finding is fixed with tests that compare AssuranceMutationRefusalError against the exported measurement-source vocabulary; the 115-test focused review suite passes, contracts and SDK surface checks are current, and the earlier packed invalid-source refusal remains typed exit 2 with no persistence."
  "2026-08-14T09:30:31.137Z","harness:codex","SDK usability follow-through: assurance declarations, actions, presets, runtime composition, and typed refusal classes are now exported through the focused sdk/governance entrypoint as well as the aggregate SDK. The published-subpath regression verifies the exact missing-trigger typed class, and the assurance guide documents host classification without message parsing. Static quality and the 7,288-test reduced-worker run passed before a concurrent coverage-directory collision; final collision-free exact coverage remains the commit gate."
  "2026-08-14T09:31:38.825Z","harness:codex","Final repository proof after the public governance-subpath export correction: 493 files / 7,288 tests passed at exact 100/100/100/100 coverage; lint, zero-clone duplication, 100% docstrings, package-boundary, SDK parity, generated contracts, and public-surface checks passed. The packed consumer classified both root and @unbrained/pm-cli/sdk/governance assurance refusals with no raw TypeError."
